          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "टाळ्या is the plural of टाळी, \"a clap\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit tāḍa, \"blow\", whose form tāla meant \"clap, rhythm\" (CDIAL 5748). वाजवणे is the \"make\" form of वाजणे, \"to sound\", from Sanskrit vādyate, \"is made to sound\" (CDIAL 11513)."
            }
          ]
